comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T17:58:02.801Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status search for required-field structural completeness and serialized payload substrings found historical completeness work including pm-57ir3b and the active transcript owner pm-8pnj, but no item for this PR #1133 gate defect; creating one review-caught child issue."
  "2026-08-27T18:17:31.612Z","harness:codex","Review resolution evidence for PR #1133: replaced serialized substring matching with dot-separated Object.hasOwn traversal from the payload root; entity/context/mutation corpus steps now declare structural paths, and an adversarial payload containing the missing field name only in prose is rejected. Focused linked tests passed; full coverage passed 8,063 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; pnpm quality:static passed."
  "2026-08-28T03:21:21.035Z","harness:codex","Review lifecycle reconciliation: a docs-link mutation was appended after the previous release event without a fresh ownership interval. This corrective append-only interval reacquires ownership, preserves the original implementation and verification evidence, and restores an unambiguous terminal lifecycle."
  "2026-08-28T07:33:24.854Z","harness:codex","TDD red for Greptile P1 recurrence: a negative control declaring required_fields=[token_accounting.total_bytes] against a collection payload failed because validateAgentTaskTokenInvocation returned success after satisfying completeness from accountedPayload even though the reported and validated independentlyProjectedPayload omits token_accounting. Focused result: 1 failed / 8 passed, exact assertion expected the invocation to throw."
  "2026-08-28T07:52:19.012Z","harness:codex","Greptile P1 recurrence resolution: moved structural required_fields completeness from accountedPayload to independentlyProjectedPayload, so accounting-only coordinates cannot certify the public projection. The new negative control failed before the fix (1 failed / 8 passed) and now passes. Focused suite: 29/29. Full coverage: 585 files, 8,083 tests, 59,952/59,952 statements, 45,139/45,139 branches, 12,469/12,469 functions, and 57,732/57,732 lines (100/100/100/100). Standalone transcript replay: 5/5 tasks, 14 steps, 2 recoveries, 4,349 estimated tokens. CI=1 pnpm quality:static passed including graph-composition and record-integrity."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T18:17:32.166Z","harness:codex","Completeness evidence must name and traverse structural coordinates; searching serialized bytes conflates keys with values and nested context, allowing a token-efficient gate to certify data the agent never received."
